# GUARD ts-offline-remote-close
#
# Restore the offline detach-enqueue refusal for a frozen remote replica.
# Pane/tab/window close must remove presentation and saved placement without
# outbound work, then remain absent when the remote replica reconnects.
test: shipping offline remote close stays absent after reconnect without outbound work
